WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
Locate the surrounding skewed cell using the source grid vectors.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:12.100
At each position, trilinear weights blend the eight stored corner values.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.000
Once the probe leaves the finite grid, its status is outside and the value is blank.
